<title>JAPAN: Nissan Diesel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Diesel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		164.39		vs	  182.14</p>
<p> Operating	    2.41		vs	    4.31</p>
<p> Current		2.32		vs	    3.84</p>
<p> Net		    1.45		vs	    2.37</p>
<p> EPS		    6.15 yen	  vs	   10.00 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    236 million	  vs	 236 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nissan Diesel Motor Co Ltd is a truck and bus manufacturer, belonging to the Nissan Motor Co Ltd group.</p>
